    "Cost": 3252372,
    "UIName": "Quickdraw",
    "Id": "chassisdef_quickdraw_QKD-QS2",
    "Name": "Quickdraw",
    "Details": "Quicsell's Heavy PPC Brawler. The QKD-QS2 has a trio of our finest Light Streak PPC's (a Quicsell exclusive) mounted in the torso, to allow for close range brawling while leaving the option open for unloading fire at the same time. Comes equiped with a 7 ton combat shield and a 6 ton variety pack of Quicsell Mech Grenades.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.06</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_quickdraw"
